cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the diagnostics it implements, please cite the article below."
title: "depbench: diagnostics for benchmarks on gene-clustered variant cohorts"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for the within-gene/between-gene decomposition of the AUC and
  the accompanying baselines, permutation nulls, calibration corrections and
  power calculations for variant-effect benchmarks on cohorts in which
  labelled variants are clustered by gene.
type: software
license: MIT
